{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coupling is an abstract style puzzle game where the only thing you can do is move around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you can still push objects, look somewhere, and step on switches. All objects interact with each other, and you need to understand and utilize the relationships between them </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to pass the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* If you find the white screen too harsh, other color configurations are available, or you can just customize the colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >70 levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 2-3 hours playtime </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 types of related objects </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abstract style graphics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some secrets spread throughout the levels</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3694470/539454f3429b5a0f2f31f8797496ae54ed656ae5.jpg"},{"name":"Museum","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3694470/49cfa5d82002639fed6eaf7ec71e494286cd2eca.jpg"},{"name":"Balance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3694470/663119d68fe6c2e0eeb8c4ca77d01e044828768b.jpg"},{"name":"Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3694470/621c87d5594a7c8685697de5d7c968dd077f3938.jpg"},{"name":"Music Box","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3694470/ad4e700c2b46db1362b1351920d3089f43e36e20.jpg"},{"name":"Player","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3694470/dcebe3ab4052038459bb8d61ae8883d5587b57c4.jpg"},{"name":"This Road Is Blocked"